sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Gateway
    participant Authz
    participant API
    participant Mongo

    User->>Frontend: Login
    Frontend->>Authz: OAuth2 + PKCE
    Authz-->>Frontend: JWT

    Frontend->>Gateway: API Request (Bearer JWT)
    Gateway->>API: Forward Request
    API->>Mongo: Query / Update
    Mongo-->>API: Result
    API-->>Gateway: JSON Response
    Gateway-->>Frontend: Response
